Implement MOSS Image base model import

Upstream ships MOSS Image inference and LoRA import but converts the base
model out of tree. The importer arms are lifted from LoRAImporter's
working .mossImage wiring, including the FP32 inputs appended at compile.

Comfy-Org's single file fuses each block's q, k and v as proj.qkv, so the
block mapper now accepts that name the way the text refiner's qkv is
already read. The official split release and the fused file convert to
identical checkpoints.

Base and SFT have identical upstream specs, so there is no release rule.
